Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:09.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记起来了  我是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember now. I'm an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:11.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被判处了死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a death sentence on my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:12.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  - 我堕落了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - I disobeyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:13.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的不该来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really shouldn't have come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:20.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须阻止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:20.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻止什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:25.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1973年\N{\fnArial\fs30}1973.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:26.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是约翰·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.53,0:00:34.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的父母是玛丽和约翰·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents are Mary and John winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.62,0:00:35.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的孙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am your grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.02,0:00:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽1983年被黄眼恶魔杀害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary gets killed by a yellow-eyed demon in 1983.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.43,0:00:41.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们现在不杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if we don't catch this thing now and kill it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.49,0:00:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一旦逃跑  玛丽就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it gets away... then Mary dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:46.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.51,0:00:55.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么都没能阻止  她还是做了交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't stop any of it. She still made the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还是死在了婴儿房  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She still died in the nursery, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.70,0:00:58.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天意不可违  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destiny can't be changed, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.01,0:01:01.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,殊途同归\N{\fnArial\fs30}All roads lead to the same destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:06.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:08.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.67,0:01:11.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愿得偿  我爱恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I take it all back. I love the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.88,0:01:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:23.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.25,0:01:25.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.59,0:01:28.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这才是世界和平啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's what I call peace on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.63,0:01:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.63,0:01:45.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我是在工作呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just, uh, working on a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.39,0:01:47.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你梦到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you dream about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.70,0:01:50.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:53.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你要进入我的意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you gate-crashing my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.56,0:01:55.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不直接在旅馆现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just swing by the motel?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.95,0:01:58.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找不到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.65,0:02:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西做的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Cass did this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.11,0:02:02.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:05.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在倒有个能指望的朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there's a friend you can count on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.46,0:02:06.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.44,0:02:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没告诉你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.95,0:02:10.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.76,0:02:11.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:13.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然不会了  他何必呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not. Why would he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.71,0:02:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:17.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,监牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:23.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无休无止的折磨  老生常谈的伪善\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the torture, twice the self-righteousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.46,0:02:24.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他为什么不告诉我们你去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't he have told us where you were?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:26.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这是拜他所赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause he's the one who turned me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:27.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look so shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.82,0:02:29.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一直是个好卒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was always a good little soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:30.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对唯命是从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did anything under orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.12,0:02:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.02,0:02:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我没多少时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. And I don't have long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:39.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我越狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I broke out --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.67,0:02:40.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差点没成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:41.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在通缉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.67,0:02:42.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they find me --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.70,0:02:44.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来见我  225号工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet me. 225 industrial.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.01,0:02:49.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了  要尽快\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, please, just hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:22.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.65,0:03:33.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:40.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是这么了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I didn't know any better...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:45.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会以为是温彻斯特不信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say the Winchester don't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.50,0:03:46.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们信  但我不\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do. I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:49.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让他们来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't let them come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:53.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能越狱  那是因为他们故意放你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're out of prison, it's because they let you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.10,0:03:56.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你来做那个黑手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they sent you here to do their dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.40,0:03:58.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你凭什么这么肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what makes you so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:04:01.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我也曾经历过天堂的劝诫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I've experienced... heaven's persuasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:03.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是指把我交给他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean when you gave me to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.51,0:04:06.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是个失误\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.51,0:04:10.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜  不论他们送你来做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna, whatever they sent you here to do --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.03,0:04:14.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是他们送我来  我逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't send me. I escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.80,0:04:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人能逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one escapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都这么多世纪了  你现在开始低估我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these centuries, and you're underestimating me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.51,0:04:22.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不是他们那边的  你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're not one of them, then what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.94,0:04:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要帮你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:25.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你要帮忙  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to help? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:27.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你想用那把刀做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what are doing with that knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.17,0:04:36.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能保护自己吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not allowed to defend myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.63,0:04:39.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对抗谁  那把刀根本伤不了天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against whom? That blade doesn't work against angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.89,0:04:41.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不像这一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.85,0:04:44.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能你不是在给上面干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're not working for heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.23,0:04:45.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你对我一定有所隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's something you're not telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆·温彻斯特必须得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester has to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.71,0:05:07.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  但是我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry. But we have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.59,0:05:10.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是路西法的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's Lucifer's vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.37,0:05:12.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他不是唯一的皮囊  - 什么  那个叫尼克的男人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's not the only one. - What? That guy Nick?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:14.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们说话的当儿他正在灰飞烟灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's burning away as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.94,0:05:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆才是最重要的那个皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam is the only vessel that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:21.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道那意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.62,0:05:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果路西法得不到萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Lucifer can't take Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:25.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的整个计划就破灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}his whole plan short-circuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:28.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有和米迦勒的决战  也没有恶魔病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fight with Michael, no croatoan virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骑士们也得乖乖地回去坚守岗位\N{\fnArial\fs30}The horsemen go back to their day jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.51,0:05:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你可以  杀了萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you could... kill Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.83,0:05:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撒旦还是会让他复活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satan would just bring him back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.37,0:05:38.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我把他的细胞驱散到横跨整个宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not after I scatter his cells
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.32,0:05:39.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他就没法子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}across the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.02,0:05:43.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们永远找不到他  找不到完整的他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll never find him -- not all of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.27,0:05:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会有别的办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:51.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你们进展如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.79,0:05:56.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科尔特效果怎么样  还有上帝找到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the colt working out? Or the search for god?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.51,0:05:58.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些办法都有用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anything working?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.91,0:06:02.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想阻止恶魔的话  只能如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to stop the devil, this is how.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:06.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是不会答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is still no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:09.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为萨姆是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Sam is my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.42,0:06:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:16.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许为时已晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:19.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我确实变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:23.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜  我们曾经一起经历过很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna, we've been through much together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.68,0:06:26.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可如果你想加害于萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you come near Sam Winchester,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.39,0:06:27.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不会放过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:48.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.15,0:06:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-老天  - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my god. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.17,0:06:53.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-老天啊  - 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my god. - Hey. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.54,0:06:55.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把她送到医院去  来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get her to a hospital. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:05.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.68,0:07:08.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不相信  - 是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't believe it. - It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.11,0:07:10.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说她开始走格伦·克洛斯范儿了(电影演员)\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she's gone all Glenn Close, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:11.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.25,0:07:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁是格伦·克洛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Glenn Close?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.80,0:07:14.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.49,0:07:16.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是个喜欢煮兔子  神经有问题的贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just this psycho bitch who likes to boil rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.86,0:07:19.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  那个要杀了我的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, t-the -- the plan to kill me --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:20.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的可以阻止撒旦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}would it actually stop Satan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会  萨姆  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sam, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.14,0:07:24.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  你怎么想  安娜说的有道理吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, what do you think? Does Anna have a point?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:28.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.97,0:07:31.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是  格伦·克洛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a... "Glenn Close."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.15,0:07:33.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:36.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们干嘛要找一个想灭掉萨姆的小妞儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for the chick that wants to gank Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.25,0:07:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛自找麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why poke the bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.57,0:07:39.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜会不断尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna will keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.07,0:07:42.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非萨姆死了  否则她不会放弃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't give up until Sam is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:45.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们先下手为强\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we kill her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.92,0:07:55.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.59,0:08:09.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我找到她了  - 她在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I found her. - Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.49,0:08:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是地点的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not where.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:12.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是时间的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}When.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:15.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在1978年\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 1978.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.85,0:08:16.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.51,0:08:20.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在1978年干什么  我都还没出生呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why 1978? I wasn't even born yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.72,0:08:24.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果她杀了你父母  也就没有你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't be... if she kills your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.79,0:08:25.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:28.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我在  安娜伤不到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna can't get to you because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.83,0:08:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以她要去找你们的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she's going after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.17,0:08:31.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上送我们回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us back right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.39,0:08:33.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这相当于让你们羊入虎口\N{\fnArial\fs30}And deliver you right to Anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.39,0:08:34.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.45,0:08:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是我们的父母  卡西  我们要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're our parents, Cass. We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:37.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这么容易的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  - 就算我可以使用荣光的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? - Time travel was difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.77,0:08:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间穿梭也是很困难的\N{\fnArial\fs30}even with the powers of heaven at my disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:43.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你堕天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你就像是少了燃料的跑车是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what? You're like a Delorean without enough plutonium?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.03,0:08:48.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不懂那个比喻什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand that reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:49.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我想说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm telling you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.65,0:08:52.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,携带其他人一起进行时间穿梭依旧会\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking this trip, with passengers, no less...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.31,0:08:55.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,削弱我的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}...it'll weaken me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.65,0:08:57.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是我们的爸妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're our mom and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:00.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can save them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:01.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不单是不让安娜伤害他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not just from Anna --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.05,0:09:04.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  如果我们能阻止这场战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if we can set things right...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:06.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.85,0:09:14.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.86,0:09:18.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凑合吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.88,0:09:19.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弯曲膝盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bend your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们成功了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.36,0:09:42.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非是他们再产品拓车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless they're bringing pintos back into production,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.15,0:09:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来  我们是成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, I'd say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:47.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.98,0:09:50.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放轻松  放轻松  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. Take it easy. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.68,0:09:51.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比我预想的要好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm much better than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.11,0:09:56.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.57,0:10:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有呼吸  虽然比较微弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's breathing... sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:02.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.78,0:10:14.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  光是看到那胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the mustaches alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.09,0:10:16.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给卡西付了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I paid for Cass for
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.27,0:10:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,5个晚上的房费  蜜月套房\N{\fnArial\fs30}five nights up in the, uh, honeymoon suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.39,0:10:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉经理  不论如何都不许打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told the manager, "Do not disturb no matter what."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.05,0:10:20.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道他跟我说什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what he said to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:23.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  别担心  想买点内幕消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Yeah. Don't sweat it. Want to buy some dope?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:25.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"内幕"唉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.95,0:10:26.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该在附近逛逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ought to stick around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:28.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后买点微软公司的股份\N{\fnArial\fs30}buy some stock in Microsoft.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果卡西无法恢复的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we might have to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:30.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,估计我们真得买股份去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Cass doesn't recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.49,0:10:33.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.54,0:10:35.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道我看起来像天使医生或是护士小妞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I look like -- Dr. Angel, medicine woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.92,0:10:36.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他自会醒来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.75,0:10:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他  可是个非常坚韧又带翅膀的臭小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, you know, tough for a little nerdy dude with wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:40.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他都搞成这样子  \N{\fnArial\fs30}If he landed like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望安娜也好不到哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}hopefully, so did Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.57,0:10:42.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我们能赢得一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should buy us some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.64,0:10:43.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  你找到他们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, did you find 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:47.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  温切斯特家  知更树街485号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Uh...The Winchesters. 485 Robin tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.04,0:10:49.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接去会会咱爸妈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go pop in on the folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:04.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  萨姆  等等  等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Sam. Wait, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.36,0:11:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  安娜可能随时出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Anna could be here any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.89,0:11:08.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们究竟该怎么进去  怎么和他们说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly are we gonna march up there and tell 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.13,0:11:09.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.69,0:11:11.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  难道说他们的儿子从未来回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, that their sons are back from the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.40,0:11:13.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是为了从天使终结者手中挽救他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To save them from an angel gone "Terminator"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.25,0:11:15.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  这年代那种电影还没出现呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Those movies haven't even come out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.93,0:11:17.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那  就告诉她恶魔要抓他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then tell her demons are after 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:18.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她认为你是个猎人  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she thinks you're a hunter, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:20.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  一个她老爸一死就立马消失了的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a hunter who disappeared right when her dad died.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.91,0:11:22.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她肯定爱死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:25.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就跟着我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:33.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天工作怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.01,0:11:35.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺  好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was, uh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.79,0:11:39.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先去洗手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Not until you wash up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:42.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是爱死你发号施令的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love when you get bossy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.51,0:11:53.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:55.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.13,0:11:56.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉如果来得不是时候的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry if this is a bad time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.97,0:11:59.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不明白  我已经不再\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.59,0:12:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我洗手不干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't do that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.27,0:12:05.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在拥有平凡的生活  你们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a normal life now. You have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:07.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  但这很重要  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but this is important, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.72,0:12:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  亲爱的  他们只不过是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sweetie, they're just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.09,0:12:14.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽的表兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary's cousins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:15.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们路过这儿一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we couldn't stop through town
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.52,0:12:17.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要来跟她打声招呼的  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}without swinging by and saying "Hey," Now, could we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:19.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.49,0:12:21.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很眼熟啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.06,0:12:23.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.73,0:12:26.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你也挺眼熟的  老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you do, too, actually, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.31,0:12:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定见过面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must have met sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.52,0:12:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在某个小镇  对吗  爱上那些小镇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small towns, right? Got to love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.45,0:12:30.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm John.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.71,0:12:36.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.25,0:12:39.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  玛丽的父亲也叫萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Uh, Mary's father was a Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.05,0:12:41.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  他这是个姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's a -- it's a family name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.88,0:12:48.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧  伙计  你似乎有点吓着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, pal? You look a little spooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:51.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  没事  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:53.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过是  旅行得太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a...long trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.24,0:12:58.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  萨姆和迪恩正要继续他们的旅程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Sam and Dean were just on their way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.45,0:13:00.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  他们才刚到这儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? They just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴有机会见到玛丽那边的亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real happy to meet folks from Mary's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.41,0:13:04.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请进来喝杯啤酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please come on in for a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:06.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正合我意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twist my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.19,0:13:14.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确实没事吗  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you're okay, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  当然  我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. Um, I'm just, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.65,0:13:22.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是太漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.77,0:13:25.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的意思是通常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He means that in a-a non-weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.23,0:13:28.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,健康的  对家人的赞美\N{\fnArial\fs30}wholesome, family kind of a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.31,0:13:29.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.28,0:13:31.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经  有很长一段时间没见玛丽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't seen Mary in -- in quite some time, and --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.15,0:13:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她简直和我们的妈妈一摸一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, she's the spitting image of our mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.11,0:13:36.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种感觉  非常  非常可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's -- it's -- Eerie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:40.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是什么关系呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how are you guys related?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.82,0:13:43.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是  远亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, uh, distantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:45.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  你们认识玛丽的父母了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. So you knew Mary's parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.81,0:13:47.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  没错  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.85,0:13:49.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary's dad was, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.35,0:13:52.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾像祖父一般疼我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}pretty much like a grandpa to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.93,0:13:57.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遗憾的是  他因心脏病发过世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was tragic -- that heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.26,0:14:01.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  太遗憾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.39,0:14:07.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  你们进城是要做什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, what are you guys doing in town, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.45,0:14:08.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接了点儿活要干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, business, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.73,0:14:09.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  什么样的工作  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? What line of work? 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:10.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-修管道  - 回收废金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Plumbing. - Scrap metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.01,0:14:12.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  都快7点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, gosh. It's almost 7:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:14.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想无礼的  但必须得去作晚餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to be rude, but I got to get dinner ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.08,0:14:16.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他们可以留下来  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they could stay. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.38,0:14:17.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定他们得走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure they have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.63,0:14:21.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  请留下来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, look, please stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:23.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这对我而言很有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it would mean a lot to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.22,0:14:25.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我没怎么和玛丽的家人见过面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I haven't met much of mary's side of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:33.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的  伍德森先生  我求你再考虑考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Mr. Woodson, I'm begging you to reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.93,0:14:36.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想  约翰  你是个出色的机械师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to, John. You're a great mechanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.19,0:14:38.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但时下局面确实不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But times ain't exactly rosy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.27,0:14:41.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兼职也行  我真的很需要这份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}E-even just part time. I really need this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:44.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你现在马上过来  我们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look. Come on in right now, let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.72,0:14:46.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们可以找到双赢的途径\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.95,0:14:47.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.83,0:14:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十分钟之内来见我  别让我等太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you in 10 minutes. Don't keep me waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.65,0:14:53.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们必须离开  马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to leave. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.17,0:14:54.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好的  听我说  - 不  你们听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, just listen - No, you listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.84,0:14:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次我见到你  我父母就被恶魔杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time I saw you, a demon killed my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.09,0:15:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你俩来找我还轻松地说成是家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you waltz in here like you're family?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.89,0:15:04.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论你想干吗  都不可能  离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you want -- no. Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.66,0:15:06.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和约翰有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and John are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.57,0:15:07.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.75,0:15:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有东西来追杀你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:11.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.32,0:15:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不是  - 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not exactly. - Well, what, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.24,0:15:15.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很难解释  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of hard to explain, okay? It's -- it's --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:16.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}An angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.22,0:15:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.89,0:15:21.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-世上没这种东西  - 我也希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no such thing. - I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.61,0:15:25.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它比恶魔强大一倍  也更烦人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're twice as strong as demons...and bigger dicks.||
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.93,0:15:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么天使要来杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would an angel want to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:29.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说来话长  我们过会儿告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long story, and we'll tell you the whole thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.72,0:15:32.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在  你要相信我们  然后马上出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}But right now, you've got to trust us, and we got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.52,0:15:35.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看我像是说谎的样子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at my face and tell me if I'm lying to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.47,0:15:39.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.66,0:15:43.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们去哪儿  - 离开这里  马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where do we go? - Out of here. We got to move now, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:44.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  但我怎么跟约翰说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. But what do I tell john?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:46.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell him --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.36,0:15:49.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.27,0:16:12.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伍德森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Woodson?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.33,0:16:14.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.76,0:17:01.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜  见到你我真想说很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could say it's good to see you, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:35.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:14.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.74,0:18:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使可不是那么容易被搞定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that easy to kill an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.43,0:18:20.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  但你可以把他们送走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But you can distract 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.04,0:18:45.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.83,0:18:47.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.17,0:18:48.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:49.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪物真的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.58,0:18:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我不知道怎么  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I didn't know how --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:53.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们猎杀怪物  三个都是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you fight them? All of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.41,0:18:54.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.79,0:18:58.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.62,0:19:02.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一生都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.59,0:19:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-约翰  我有我的苦衷  - 她身不由己\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John, just try to understand -- - She didn't exactly have a choice --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.71,0:19:08.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  都闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.36,0:19:10.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再说了  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, not another word, or so help me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.35,0:19:12.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我就掉头开回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will turn this car around!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.60,0:19:20.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是一次尴尬的全家公路旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Awkward family road trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.20,0:19:22.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别讲笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.13,0:19:34.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方一直是我们家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place has been in the family for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:38.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Devil's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.74,0:19:40.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纯铁制装修\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pure iron fixtures, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.67,0:19:43.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,储藏室里应该有盐和圣水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, there should be salt and holy water in the pantry,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.09,0:19:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有刀和枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knives, guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.57,0:19:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些只能赶走它\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that stuff will do is piss it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.17,0:19:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怎么才能杀它  或至少拖点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what will kill it? Or slow it down, at least?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.49,0:19:52.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些作用不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.97,0:19:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:56.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只是说作用不大  不是没作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said not much, not nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.93,0:19:57.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这个东西画出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we put this up...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.62,0:20:06.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果她靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she comes close,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.97,0:20:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就能把她送到星际飞船上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We beam her right off the starship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.11,0:20:12.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是圣油\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is holy oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.39,0:20:15.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就好像是  天使的"恶魔陷阱"\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of like a -- like a devil's trap for angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.38,0:20:18.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  我来演示一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I'll show you how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.04,0:20:30.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那纸上的东西有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's the deal with the thing on the paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.24,0:20:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是符咒  意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a sigil. That means --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:36.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不管它什么意思  要把它画哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what it means. Where does it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.07,0:20:39.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墙上或者门上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a wall or a door.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.37,0:20:41.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要画多大\N{\fnArial\fs30}How big should I make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.73,0:20:44.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.48,0:20:45.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.44,0:20:48.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可能都把我当傻瓜一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all might have treated me like a fool,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.49,0:20:49.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不是个废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am not useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.86,0:20:54.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以画一个该死的  叫什么  魔印\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can draw a damn... whatever it is -- a sigil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.93,0:20:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如你去帮萨姆那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go help Sam out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.18,0:21:00.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, 'cause this has got to be done in...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.81,0:21:03.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用人血来画\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be done in human blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.37,0:21:18.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要画多大\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how big?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.22,0:21:22.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.82,0:21:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笑什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:33.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一瞬间  你让我想起了我的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of a sudden, you -- you really remind me of my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:51.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,画得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.30,0:21:55.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是来检查作业的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come to check on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.57,0:22:02.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想说  我感到很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to say I-I'm sorry about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:03.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对所有的这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I know it's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.93,0:22:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道这些猎杀恶魔的事多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, how long have you known about this... hunting stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.06,0:22:11.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从一开始就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.47,0:22:14.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸就是这样把我带大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad raised me in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.36,0:22:15.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.63,0:22:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁他妈的会这样对一个小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell does that to a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.38,0:22:22.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据我所知  玛丽的爸妈就是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, for the record, mary's parents did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.94,0:22:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:25.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样的一个不负责任的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, what kind of irresponsible bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.13,0:22:27.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会让一孩子面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lets a child anywhere near --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.29,0:22:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可能会没命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you know, you could've been killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.96,0:22:32.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也差点儿就呜呼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh... came kind of close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.33,0:22:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是不止一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}The number it must've done on your head...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.93,0:22:40.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲理应保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father was supposed to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.41,0:22:43.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.47,0:22:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竭尽全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.83,0:22:53.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.51,0:22:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经生他的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to be mad at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.30,0:22:59.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说曾经\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I mean, I used to...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.00,0:23:03.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经恨过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to hate the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:04.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.27,0:23:07.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.47,0:23:10.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经尽了全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was...just doing the best he could.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.22,0:23:14.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他努力坚持下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he was trying to keep it together
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.35,0:23:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使是在那种不可能的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}In -- in -- in this impossible situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.58,0:23:20.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.18,0:23:23.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.82,0:23:28.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她神奇  美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was amazing, beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.17,0:23:31.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是他一生的挚爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And... she was the love of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.24,0:23:34.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she got killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:37.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...I think
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.93,0:23:40.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他什么也不做的话  是会疯掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would have gone crazy if he didn't do \N{\fnArial\fs30}something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.02,0:23:46.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.16,0:23:48.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad died
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.26,0:23:51.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还没来得及告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I got to tell him that...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.37,0:23:55.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.11,0:23:59.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他所做所为的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}...why he did what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.46,0:24:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我原谅他以前对我们做过的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I forgive him for what it did to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.94,0:24:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.23,0:24:06.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.99,0:24:12.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.15,0:24:28.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤利尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.55,0:24:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你看上去不错  - 你不应该召唤我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look well. - You shouldn't have \N{\fnArial\fs30}called.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.88,0:24:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们被严令禁止下到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're under strict orders not to come \N{\fnArial\fs30}down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.94,0:24:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更不用说带着皮囊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much less take a vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.08,0:24:46.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是现在的安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the Anna of now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.48,0:24:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  但是30年后的安娜还是你的上级\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but 30 years from now, I'm still your \N{\fnArial\fs30}superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.87,0:24:53.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你杀几个人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to kill some humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.12,0:24:56.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总是乐意去毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always happy to do some smiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.18,0:24:58.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.26,0:25:01.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在未来  这些人会杀了你  尤利尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the future, these people are going to \N{\fnArial\fs30}kill you, Uriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.06,0:25:06.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在给你机会先杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm giving you the chance to kill them \N{\fnArial\fs30}first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.77,0:25:09.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.35,0:25:16.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.17,0:25:19.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说过有空的时候就给我们解释这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you'd explain everything when we \N{\fnArial\fs30}had a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.10,0:25:21.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们有空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.25,0:25:23.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么天使想让我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does an angel want me dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.15,0:25:29.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们是混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause they're dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.53,0:25:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个解释不够好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.82,0:25:36.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至都不知道他们的存在  现在我是靶子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even know they existed, and now \N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a target?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.24,0:25:38.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个挺复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.95,0:25:40.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.23,0:25:43.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洗耳恭听\N{\fnArial\fs30}All ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.01,0:25:49.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要相信我  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna have to trust me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.44,0:25:51.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trusting you all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.52,0:25:54.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.77,0:25:56.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then. I'm walking out the \N{\fnArial\fs30}door.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.94,0:25:58.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.83,0:26:02.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.76,0:26:08.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.20,0:26:11.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  我不知道还能怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I don't know how else to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.37,0:26:15.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来自2010年\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're from the year 2010.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.35,0:26:18.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个天使把我们瞬移到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}An angel zapped us back here...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.74,0:26:21.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是攻击你的那个  而是个友好的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the one that attacked you -- \N{\fnArial\fs30}friendlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.51,0:26:26.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别指望我会相信这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't expect me to believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.11,0:26:32.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的名字是迪恩和萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our names are Dean and Sam winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.09,0:26:35.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是以你父母的名字来命名的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're named after your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.28,0:26:39.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我生病的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I would get sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.99,0:26:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会给我做番茄米汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would make me tomato-rice soup,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.24,0:26:46.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这是你妈妈给你做过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's what your mom made you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.11,0:26:49.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不给我们唱摇篮曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And instead of a lullaby...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.18,0:26:52.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是唱"Hey Jude"\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would sing "Hey Jude"...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.14,0:26:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这首是你最喜欢的披头士的歌曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}...'cause that's your favorite beatles \N{\fnArial\fs30}song.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.70,0:26:59.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.67,0:27:02.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.59,0:27:04.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.15,0:27:06.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  但这都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.27,0:27:12.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把我的孩子培养成了猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I raised my kids to be hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.63,0:27:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.62,0:27:16.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么能那样对你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I do that to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.91,0:27:18.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.98,0:27:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...because you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.80,0:27:29.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.37,0:27:32.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黄眼恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yellow-eyed demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.26,0:27:37.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed you, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.67,0:27:42.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰成了猎魔人为你报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}...John became a hunter to get revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.31,0:27:46.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把我们养大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He raised us in this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.49,0:27:50.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.40,0:27:55.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个恶魔进入了山姆的婴儿房\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon comes into Sam's nursery
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.40,0:27:58.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他刚满6个月的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly six months after he's born --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.23,0:27:59.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1983年11月2日\N{\fnArial\fs30}November 2, 1983.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.07,0:28:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记住这个日期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that date.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.40,0:28:02.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whatever you do...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.46,0:28:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.26,0:28:08.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个早晨  你要醒来带上山姆快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wake up that morning and you take Sam \N{\fnArial\fs30}and you run.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.63,0:28:10.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个方法不够好  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not good enough, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.14,0:28:15.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管她跑去哪里  那个恶魔都会找到她 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever she goes, the demon's gonna find \N{\fnArial\fs30}her...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.92,0:28:18.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.82,0:28:20.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那你说怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.84,0:28:26.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可以离开爸爸  那才是解决办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can leave dad. That's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.36,0:28:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须离开约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to leave John.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.98,0:28:32.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.64,0:28:35.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当这一切过去以后  请离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this is all over, walk away...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.37,0:28:36.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再也别回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And never look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.94,0:28:41.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样我们就不会出生了  他说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're never born. He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.43,0:28:42.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.38,0:28:46.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们告诉我你们是我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying that you're my children,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.37,0:28:47.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你们又说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're saying --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.59,0:28:48.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有别的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.66,0:28:50.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有出生过和死掉相比\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a big difference between
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.14,0:28:51.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是有很大区别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}dying and never being born.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.92,0:28:53.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  我们无所谓的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And trust me, we're okay with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.96,0:28:54.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.69,0:28:55.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.58,0:28:57.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  你觉得你可以过上渴望已久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you think you can have that normal life
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.61,0:29:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正常人生活  但是你做不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you want so bad... but you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.31,0:29:02.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.00,0:29:04.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情将会变得一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all gonna go rotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.08,0:29:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你将会死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna die,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.54,0:29:11.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你的孩子们将会被诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your children will be cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.08,0:29:19.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定  一定还有别的办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There -- there has to be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.28,0:29:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  这是唯一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.23,0:29:21.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave John.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.01,0:29:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.77,0:29:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不止是我俩的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bigger than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.89,0:29:28.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将有无数的生命受到威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are so many more lives at stake --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.16,0:29:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不会理解的  我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.89,0:29:36.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,木已成舟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.24,0:29:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.87,0:29:44.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.59,0:29:48.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we got a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.34,0:29:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些用血画的魔印 它们消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those blood things, the sigils -- they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.87,0:29:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone as in...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.84,0:29:54.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我在后门上画了一个魔印\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I drew one on the back of the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.22,0:29:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turned around.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.80,0:29:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再看的时候就变成一块污点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I looked back again, it was a smudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.70,0:30:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.05,0:30:05.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣油也没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no more holy oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.83,0:30:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你究竟是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.26,0:30:43.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是尤利尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Uriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.72,0:30:45.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.39,0:30:47.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.11,0:30:54.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无路可退了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here goes nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.39,0:31:20.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.95,0:31:38.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.41,0:31:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.47,0:32:08.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我非常的抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.85,0:32:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.08,0:32:16.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.87,0:32:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.99,0:32:47.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.03,0:32:49.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见  尤利尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Uriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.12,0:32:55.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把约翰怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what did you do to John?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.89,0:32:56.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}John is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.03,0:32:59.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁  你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who -- what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.38,0:33:15.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真是咱们之间迟来的谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd say this conversation is long overdue,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.57,0:33:17.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不是吗  - 治好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wouldn't you?  - Fix him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.24,0:33:18.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先...\N{\fnArial\fs30}First...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.58,0:33:21.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们来谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.23,0:33:24.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我治好你那可爱的小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I fix your darling little Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.45,0:33:29.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么附身我爸爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get in my dad, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.50,0:33:31.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉他我可以救他的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him I could save his wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.72,0:33:33.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后他就同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.64,0:33:36.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来是他们吹的太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess they oversold me
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.86,0:33:39.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说我是你唯一的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being your one and only vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.53,0:33:42.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的确是我的皮囊  但不是我唯一的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my true vessel but not my only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.48,0:33:43.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.80,0:33:45.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,决定因素在于血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.40,0:33:46.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bloodline?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.35,0:33:48.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上溯到该隐和亚伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stretching back to Cain and Abel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.45,0:33:50.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有这样的血统  你父亲有这样的血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in your blood, your father's blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.84,0:33:52.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你们家族的血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your family's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.19,0:33:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.75,0:33:57.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天堂腌肉的命运锁链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six degrees of heaven bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.62,0:34:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要我怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.14,0:34:02.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当真不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really don't know the answer to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.20,0:34:03.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我不会同意你的附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know I ain't gonna say yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.56,0:34:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么还要来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}so why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.34,0:34:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想把我怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.55,0:34:08.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想让你明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to understand
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.77,0:34:11.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我必须完成的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you and I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.32,0:34:13.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.06,0:34:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对你的兄弟有一肚子牢骚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got beef with your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.83,0:34:18.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去接受心理治疗吧  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, get some therapy, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.02,0:34:19.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take it out on my planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.72,0:34:22.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.58,0:34:27.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法违抗我们的父亲  背叛了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer defied our father, and he betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.68,0:34:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是依然\N{\fnArial\fs30}But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.13,0:34:30.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你不愿杀死萨姆一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want this any more
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.89,0:34:32.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一点都不想这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}than you would want to kill sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.92,0:34:39.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道  我的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, my brother --
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.62,0:34:42.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上是我抚养他长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I practically raised him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.73,0:34:43.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我照顾他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took care of him
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.94,0:34:46.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用一种常人无法理解的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a way most people could never understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.75,0:34:48.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且我依然爱着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I still love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.61,0:34:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我会杀掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am going to kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.13,0:34:56.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为那是正确的也是我必须做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it is right and I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.65,0:34:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-因为是上帝的旨意  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, because god says so?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.37,0:35:00.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从一开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.14,0:35:03.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就知道这件事将会怎样收场\N{\fnArial\fs30}he knew this was how it was going to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.87,0:35:06.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会服从上帝的一切旨意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're just gonna do whatever god says.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.95,0:35:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是个好儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, because I am a good son.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.35,0:35:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  相信我  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, trust me, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.30,0:35:14.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过往经验告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it from someone who knows --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.31,0:35:15.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这条路可走不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a dead-end street.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.59,0:35:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自以为比上帝看得更远吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think you know better than my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.58,0:35:21.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是个渺小的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}One unimportant little man --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.73,0:35:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭什么认为自己可以自作主张\N{\fnArial\fs30}what makes you think you get to choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.60,0:35:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我相信  对于自己渺小的生活  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I got to believe that I can choose what I do
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.72,0:35:31.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以自己做主\N{\fnArial\fs30}with my... unimportant little life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.55,0:35:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.79,0:35:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.68,0:35:48.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想看  在万般巧合下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of a million random acts of chance
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.98,0:35:51.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰和玛丽出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}that let John and Mary be born,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.35,0:35:55.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们邂逅  相爱  并怀上你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}to meet, to fall in love, to have the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.58,0:35:59.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而又在万般机缘下  你所作出的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of the million random choices that you make --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.62,0:36:01.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从头到尾  自始至终\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet how each and every one of them
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.90,0:36:04.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是令你更屈从于自身的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}brings you closer to your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.18,0:36:09.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know why that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.38,0:36:14.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这不是什么巧合机缘  不是靠运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's not random. It's not chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.23,0:36:19.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是一局棋  不随他人意志而转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a plan that is playing itself out perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.34,0:36:24.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么自由意志不过你的错觉  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free will's an illusion, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.47,0:36:29.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  你终究会答应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're going to say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.06,0:36:32.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, buck up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.72,0:36:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没你想象得这么糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.38,0:36:35.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要知道  我和其他天使们不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, unlike my brothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.56,0:36:38.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对你可不会用烂就丢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't leave you a drooling mess when I'm done wearing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.00,0:36:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我爸爸呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what about my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.24,0:36:41.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完好无损\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than new.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.21,0:36:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我还会帮你爸妈一个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I'm gonna do your mom and your dad a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.69,0:36:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.55,0:36:48.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抹去他们的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrub their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.32,0:36:50.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们什么也不会记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't remember me or you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.96,0:36:52.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.90,0:36:55.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是按她的意愿去做而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just giving your mother what she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.61,0:36:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会回到丈夫和家人身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can go back to her husband, her family --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.13,0:36:59.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样一来她那天还是会去婴儿房\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna walk right into that nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.12,0:37:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.32,0:37:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实你早已明白  不论怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you always knew that was going to play out
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.18,0:37:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,写好的剧本总会上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.14,0:37:15.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你无法反抗上帝的意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't fight city hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.87,0:37:34.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's home...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.62,0:37:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安然无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.48,0:37:40.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.51,0:37:44.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回见了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you soon, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.00,0:38:05.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.83,0:38:08.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  抱住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass! We got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.11,0:38:09.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼的  你成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch. You made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.32,0:38:10.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.06,0:38:12.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.89,0:38:15.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是出乎意料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.67,0:38:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂喂  你没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! You're okay. Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.14,0:38:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快躺床上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bed? Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.43,0:38:28.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I could use that drink now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.95,0:38:29.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.20,0:38:31.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.94,0:38:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.44,0:38:36.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.44,0:38:38.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自由意志三人组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.23,0:38:40.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个有恶魔血瘾史的笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}One ex-blood junkie,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.33,0:38:43.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个在地狱为五斗米折腰的蠢材\N{\fnArial\fs30}One dropout with 6 bucks to his name,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.34,0:38:45.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再加上躺那儿昏迷不醒的糊涂天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Mr. Comatose over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.17,0:38:45.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酷毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.09,0:38:47.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.09,0:38:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又没笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.63,0:38:57.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都说我们会妥协\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all say we'll say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.35,0:38:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是  烦不烦啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It's getting annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.38,0:39:00.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们是对的怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they're right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.26,0:39:02.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没这回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.16,0:39:05.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我们中会有一个 ...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, w-why -- why would we, either of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.74,0:39:06.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.53,0:39:09.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前就曾妥协过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been weak before.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.57,0:39:10.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.45,0:39:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸就答应了米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael got dad to say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.23,0:39:13.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.00,0:39:15.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为安娜要杀了妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna was about to kill mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.99,0:39:17.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你可以救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you could save mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.41,0:39:19.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.94,0:39:26.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是从哪里弄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you even get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.46,0:39:29.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,旧货清仓  只要25美分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garage sale. 25 cents.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.89,0:39:32.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样  这还是挺欣慰的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm glad to hear that, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.01,0:39:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  你难道不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you really don't think
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.21,0:39:37.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有点劣质吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's just a-a little cheesy?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.77,0:39:41.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mnh-mnh. I think it's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.27,0:39:46.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不出理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't even put my finger on why I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.22,0:39:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.81,0:39:51.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.41,0:39:55.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢我就喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.41,0:40:08.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一脚踢得真有劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite a kick there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.70,0:40:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在妈妈肚子里就这么调皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Troublemaker already.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.78,0:40:15.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  我的宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, baby. It's all okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.72,0:40:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有天使守护着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels are watching over you.
